title: scigantic-msa
abstract: "Build protein MSAs from the ColabFold MMseqs2 server merged with published open alignments (OpenFold3, LiteFold, OpenProteinSet), and write the input files for AlphaFold 3, Boltz, Chai-1, ColabFold, OpenFold3 or Protenix."
